  "title": "Savory Bacon and Crab Bread Pudding Eggs Benedict",
  "description": "Smoky bacon and sweet crab make this bread pudding a flavorful twist on a classic Eggs Benedict. Try this elegant dish for a special breakfast or brunch.",
  "authors": [
